 height=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" rx=\"0\" id=\"dubai-information-en-m-region-10\" data-label-region=\"true\"/>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"513\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\" font-family=\"l0g Dubai Papers Investigation\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-panel=\"dubai-information-en-m-region-10\" data-painted-panel=\"dubai-information-en-m-painted-8\">Relevant tax residence</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"549.5\" width=\"384\" height=\"32.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" rx=\"0\" id=\"dubai-information-en-m-region-11\" data-label-region=\"true\"/>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"572\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\" font-family=\"l0g Dubai Papers Investigation\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-panel=\"dubai-information-en-m-region-11\">UAE: first outgoing exchanges in 2018,</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"579.5\" width=\"384\" height=\"32.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" rx=\"0\" id=\"dubai-information-en-m-region-12\" data-label-region=\"true\"/>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"602\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\" font-family=\"l0g Dubai Papers Investigation\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-panel=\"dubai-information-en-m-region-12\">according to the 2022 OECD review.</text>\n<line x1=\"24\" y1=\"633\" x2=\"376\" y2=\"633\" stroke=\"var(--color-line-strong)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"649.5\" width=\"384\" height=\"32.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" rx=\"0\" id=\"dubai-information-en-m-region-13\" data-label-region=\"true\"/>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"672\" fill=\"var(--color-amber)\" font-family=\"l0g Dubai Papers Investigation\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-panel=\"dubai-information-en-m-region-13\">TRACFIN · SEPARATE CHANNEL</text>\n<rect x=\"19\" y=\"692\" width=\"105\" height=\"42\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" rx=\"0\" id=\"dubai-information-en-m-region-14\" data-label-region=\"true\"/>\n<text x=\"24\" y=\"720\" fill=\"var(--color-p